+## Usage across tool rounds
+
+- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits, and receives usage that covers every provider call in the turn — the sum across all tool rounds, not the most recent round's usage alone — so a deployer billing or auditing from this hook counts the full cost of tool-heavy turns ([validated by: afterModelResponse receives summed usage across all tool rounds, not only the last round](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L40)).
+
